{
  "_comment": [
    "KNOWN, PRE-EXISTING i18n debt — not a target, a ceiling.",
    "",
    "Before 2026-08-30 scripts/i18n-audit.mjs ran a blind allow-list regex that hid",
    "any string containing a parenthesis, ellipsis, or similar punctuation, so the",
    "audit reported one finding for the whole app and src/i18n/__tests__/drained.test.js",
    "asserted the audit was completely empty. Repairing the regex to a deny-list",
    "surfaced these findings for real, in components this branch has not localized yet.",
    "",
    "drained.test.js checks that the CURRENT audit output is a SUBSET of this file, not",
    "equal to it. Localizing one of these strings and deleting its entry here is a pure",
    "improvement and never breaks that test — the list is expected to shrink over time",
    "as more components get localized, but nothing forces it to shrink on any schedule.",
    "",
    "Adding an entry here is a deliberate, reviewed exception (e.g. a string that is",
    "genuinely not translatable yet), not a way to silence a red test. If you're adding",
    "one, say why in the pull request — a hardcoded string that is simply new should be",
    "wrapped in t() instead."
  ],
